comments[4]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-09-04T11:51:40.569Z","harness:codex","Duplicate sweep 2026-09-04: live all-status searches for 'Windows release verifier surviving server intermediate runner stderr' and 'verify-published-release Windows' found the historical portability owners pm-j668gl and pm-07pt16 but no item for this inverted test/evaluator timeout contract. Evidence: main CI run 33867283305 failed with empty stderr at the invalid-discovery assertion; an exact failed-job rerun passed on merge SHA 980dce4e25e2dfdec797d45364a8f0369cfb5adf."
  "2026-09-04T11:52:09.579Z","harness:codex","Root cause: the surviving-server regression inherited the evaluator's 15000 ms default readiness allowance but spawnSync enforced 10000 ms. The evaluator also reserves 2000 ms for governed cleanup, so the harness could terminate 7000 ms before the product contract completed and return empty stderr. The exact-SHA rerun passed, confirming timing sensitivity. Repair will inject a test readiness bound and explicitly assert readiness plus shutdown headroom below the outer deadline while preserving invalid-discovery and port-reuse assertions."
  "2026-09-04T12:02:13.039Z","harness:codex","Verification evidence: the PM-linked focused verifier suite passed 31/31 tests. Repo-wide coverage passed 603 files and 8,356 tests at exact 100/100/100/100. The first PM-linked static run reached the repository assurance stage and correctly refused because schema-isolated linked execution cannot see the source tracker item that owns the working-tree defect; the standalone defect-evidence gate passes against the live tracker. The static link was removed to preserve sandbox isolation, and the final static gate will run directly after terminal evidence and changelog generation."
  "2026-09-04T12:08:08.320Z","harness:codex","Terminal local gates: pnpm quality:static passed the complete repository static suite after the item carried terminal gate evidence and the latest pm-changelog 2026.9.2 generated CHANGELOG.md. The exact coverage run passed 603 files and 8,356 tests at 100% statements, branches, functions, and lines. The exact main SHA rerun 33867283305 also passed Windows, coverage, static, compatibility, smoke, and analyzer jobs, demonstrating the prior failure was intermittent while preserving it as a repaired regression."
